  "articleBody": "Before ordering custom kitchen cabinets, define how the kitchen must function, document the existing room, establish a realistic scope, and ask the remodeling provider to coordinate design, materials, installation, and related construction. Confirm measurements, appliance locations, storage priorities, finish selections, hardware, countertop interfaces, and any plumbing or electrical changes before approving the final plan.",
